WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the S13 live build clip: the opening narration of Superman (Fleischer Studios,
1941, "The Mad Scientist"), public domain. DRAFT (Nov 19): Claude wrote this without hearing
the audio, from the published opening narration, and published scripts don't always match
the final cut. Times assume the clip starts as the narrator begins. Play the trimmed clip once
and fix the words and the cue times before class.

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
In the endless reaches of the universe,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
there once existed a planet known as Krypton,

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
a planet that burned like a green star
in the distant heavens.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
There, civilization was far advanced,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
and it brought forth a race of supermen

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
whose mental and physical powers were developed
to the absolute peak of human perfection.
